OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer 'thankful to be alive'
OL,4,Aafter falling through roof in workplace
OL,5,Aaccident
OL,6,
OL,7,FRichard Spence was working at his
OL,8,Ffamily farm when he fell through the
OL,9,Froof of a cow shed, breaking a number
OL,10,Fof ribs and bones in his back.
OL,12,FHe believes he is lucky to be alive,
OL,13,Fafter spending months in hospital and
OL,14,Fbeing diagnosed with a brain injury as
OL,15,Fa result of head injuries from the
OL,16,Ffall.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
