OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer 'thankful to be alive'
OL,4,Aafter falling through roof in workplace
OL,5,Aaccident
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow, he is raising awareness of the
OL,8,Fdangers of working at heights,
OL,9,Femphasising that if someone gets
OL,10,Finjured, their family and friends are
OL,11,Fimpacted too "so just take a minute,
OL,12,Fand don't take any risks".
OL,14,FMore than 80 people have died and over
OL,15,F1,800 people have suffered major
OL,16,Finjuries in workplace accidents across
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland during the last five
OL,18,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
